List methodologies (system + account)

Usage: vendo measurement methodologies list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --no-system       Exclude system-seeded methodologies
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --output <field>  Print one field per row (e.g. id, name)
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement methodologies list
  $ vendo measurement methodologies list --no-system
  $ vendo measurement methodologies list --json
  $ vendo measurement methodologies list --output id
